`Shade` is one default hair color, with these fields in this order: `name` (text), f32s `r`, `g`, `b` (the linear color), `gain` and `dye` (1 for a color natural pigment cannot make).

`SHADES` is the constant table of default hair colors, in this order:
```table SHADES Shade
